note: the words given to the program (system_words.args: Paris 19 two-words)
say the words given to the program
say the number of words given to the program
say word 1 given to the program
let n be 2
say (word n given to the program) as a number plus 1
say word (n plus 1) given to the program
for each word in the words given to the program:
    say "- " followed by word
let words be the words given to the program
add "more" to the end of words
say the number of words given to the program
say words
